# Pao (liability) for Daisuushii (Big Four Winds) on tsumo in both rulesets
# (engine.md §4.2 Pao, rules.md §1 pao_daisuushii, natural_double_yakuman, §4.31).
# Honba: 1.
# Seat 1 pons 1z (from S0), 2z (from S3), 3z (from S0), then Seat 2 discards 4z -> Seat 1 calls pon:44z!
# That 4th wind meld sets Daisuushii pao on Seat 2.
# Seat 1 draws 8s (completing pair 88s) and wins by tsumo:
#   - Mahjong Soul: Daisuushii is 2x Yakuman (64000) + 300 honba = 64300 paid 100% by Seat 2!
#   - Tenhou: Daisuushii is 1x Yakuman (32000) + 300 honba = 32300 paid 100% by Seat 2!

